<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-TALLINNA LIISING TO TAKE SYNDICATED LOAN.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-TALLINNA LIISING TO TAKE SYNDICATED LOAN.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Panga Liising, the leasing subsidary of Tallinna Pank , plans to take a syndicated loan of at least 25 million marks, the bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The loan is guaranteed by Tallinna Pank and arranged by Japanese Sumitomo Bank, Tallinna's project financing group head Helgi Kell told Reuters.</p>
<p>The placing is due to start at the end of July, she said.</p>
<p>The preliminary sum of the loan is 25 million marks which may be increased is their is demand, she added.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuter.ee</p>
</text>
